                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi win mere ma wimako wor gi jowoti win aka wicwakere i yoto, paka Were ocwako win i Kristo.",
